<section class="legal-body container">
  <div class="legal-content" style="grid-column:1/-1;max-width:900px;margin:0 auto">
    <div class="legal-section" id="booking-help">
      <h2 data-i18n="legal.help.toc1">Booking Tickets</h2>
      <p data-i18n="legal.help.body1">Enter your departure city, destination and date of journey on the homepage search box, pick your bus and seats, then complete payment. A confirmed ticket is sent to you via email and SMS.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="legal-section" id="payment-help">
      <h2 data-i18n="legal.terms.toc3b">Payments</h2>
      <p data-i18n="legal.help.body2">We accept UPI, debit/credit cards and net banking through our secure payment gateway. If a payment fails but amount is deducted, it is auto-refunded within 5-7 business days.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="legal-section" id="passes-help">
      <h2 data-i18n="legal.help.toc4">Passes &amp; Discounts</h2>
      <p data-i18n="legal.help.body3">Monthly, student, senior citizen, corporate and family passes are available. Visit the Passes section on our homepage to apply.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="legal-section" id="tours-help">
      <h2 data-i18n="legal.help.toc5">Tour &amp; Charter Booking</h2>
      <p data-i18n="legal.help.body4">Charter a bus for group tours, weddings, corporate trips or pilgrimages. Enquire via the Tour Booking section for custom packages.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="legal-section" id="account-help">
      <h2 data-i18n="legal.help.toc6">Account &amp; Login</h2>
      <p data-i18n="legal.help.body5">Create an account or log in to track bookings, save passenger details and view your travel history.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="legal-section" id="faqs">
      <h2 data-i18n="legal.help.faqTitle">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details class="faq-item"><summary data-i18n="legal.help.faq1.q">How do I book a bus ticket?</summary><p data-i18n="legal.help.faq1.a">Enter your departure city, destination and travel date on the homepage search box, choose a bus, select your seats and complete payment. Your confirmed ticket is sent by email and SMS right away.</p></details>
        <details class="faq-item"><summary data-i18n="legal.help.faq2.q">How do I cancel a ticket?</summary><p data-i18n="legal.help.faq2.a">Open My Bookings, select the ticket you want to cancel and confirm the cancellation. Refunds follow the cancellation policy based on how close to departure you cancel.</p></details>
        <details class="faq-item"><summary data-i18n="legal.help.faq3.q">How long does a refund take?</summary><p data-i18n="legal.help.faq3.a">Refunds for cancelled tickets or failed payments are processed within 5-7 business days back to your original payment method.</p></details>
        <details class="faq-item"><summary data-i18n="legal.help.faq4.q">Can I book luggage or a parcel online?</summary><p data-i18n="legal.help.faq4.a">Yes. Use the Luggage/Parcel Booking page to send parcels or luggage across our route network with tracked delivery.</p></details>
        <details class="faq-item"><summary data-i18n="legal.help.faq5.q">How can I track my booking?</summary><p data-i18n="legal.help.faq5.a">Use the Track Booking page with your PNR or registered mobile number to see live status, boarding point and departure time.</p></details>
        <details class="faq-item"><summary data-i18n="legal.help.faq6.q">How do bus passes work?</summary><p data-i18n="legal.help.faq6.a">Monthly, student, senior citizen and corporate passes let frequent travellers ride at a discounted fare. Apply from the Passes page and use the pass at checkout on eligible routes.</p></details>
        <details class="faq-item"><summary data-i18n="legal.help.faq7.q">What payment methods are accepted?</summary><p data-i18n="legal.help.faq7.a">We accept UPI, debit/credit cards and net banking through a secure payment gateway. If an amount is deducted but the booking fails, it is auto-refunded.</p></details>
        <details class="faq-item"><summary data-i18n="legal.help.faq8.q">Do I need to create an account to book a ticket?</summary><p data-i18n="legal.help.faq8.a">No, you can book as a guest. Creating an account lets you save passenger details, view booking history and manage cancellations faster.</p></details>
        <details class="faq-item"><summary data-i18n="legal.help.faq9.q">What if I miss my bus?</summary><p data-i18n="legal.help.faq9.a">Please arrive at the boarding point at least 15 minutes before departure. A missed bus is treated as a no-show and is not eligible for a refund.</p></details>
        <details class="faq-item"><summary data-i18n="legal.help.faq10.q">Can I change my seat after booking?</summary><p data-i18n="legal.help.faq10.a">Seat changes aren't available online after booking. Cancel the ticket (as per the cancellation policy) and book again with your preferred seat.</p></details>
        <details class="faq-item"><summary data-i18n="legal.help.faq11.q">How do I book a group or charter bus?</summary><p data-i18n="legal.help.faq11.a">Use the Tour & Group Booking page to request a charter bus for group tours, weddings, corporate trips or pilgrimages, and our team will get in touch with a quote.</p></details>
        <details class="faq-item"><summary data-i18n="legal.help.faq12.q">Who do I contact for help with a booking?</summary><p data-i18n="legal.help.faq12.a">Reach our support team by email or phone from the Contact Us page - we're available every day to help with bookings, cancellations and refunds.</p></details>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="legal-section" id="contact-us">
      <h2 data-i18n="legal.help.stillNeedHelp">Still Need Help?</h2>
      <p><span data-i18n="legal.help.body6Prefix">Reach our support team at</span> <a href="mailto:support@mahaveerbusservice.com">support@mahaveerbusservice.com</a> <span data-i18n="legal.help.body6Or">or call</span> <a href="tel:+919829372120">+91 8740004790</a><span data-i18n="legal.help.body6Suffix">, daily 24x7.</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

